# Story page: nm-clockwork
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Overclock
---
Someone wound the citadel too tight.

The spikes came up early and went down late, and the gears ground so loudly that {name} could no longer hear itself count.

'Time is a machine,' said the coil, 'and you are a moving part.' I asked which part. It did not answer. I suspect it was a small one.
